{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Playable Characters, Two Perspectives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e66ad8a1e1c50ae047a975d8271a74a2.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e66ad8a1e1c50ae047a975d8271a74a2.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e66ad8a1e1c50ae047a975d8271a74a2.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience the story from both Koray and Mina\u2019s point of view, each with their own abilities and gameplay moments. Switch perspectives to uncover every side of the mystery.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Mina\u2019s Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/43ff7b0efe1e08f158aa1352264c2885.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/43ff7b0efe1e08f158aa1352264c2885.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/43ff7b0efe1e08f158aa1352264c2885.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overcome enemies and manipulate your surroundings using Mina\u2019s unique abilities. Each power unlocks new ways to play and survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e50658660ffa716ccb199183c4150eba.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e50658660ffa716ccb199183c4150eba.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/e50658660ffa716ccb199183c4150eba.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Escape terrifying dreamlike corridors inspired by the Backrooms, where monsters are always one step behind. Every turn hides a new danger will you make it out?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Stakes Police Chases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/f6a0ba5d412af141776db794affc84d2.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/f6a0ba5d412af141776db794affc84d2.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/f6a0ba5d412af141776db794affc84d2.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use your reflexes and wits to evade relentless police vehicles in thrilling pursuit sequences. Adrenaline pumping moments keep you on edge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/09babf0746f5c6dcec03468b738e4fe4.poster.avif?t=1756817553\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/09babf0746f5c6dcec03468b738e4fe4.webm?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/extras/09babf0746f5c6dcec03468b738e4fe4.mp4?t=1756817553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face off against dangerous enemies in tactical firefights. Stay alert every second counts when survival is on the line.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525320?t=1756817553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/1a10f06a4a8ae66f4a3341b469f144391b252896/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756817553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/c669291a4aa612417aa6fb95f29b4399f9cfd73a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756817553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525320/c669291a4aa612417aa6fb95f29b4399f9cfd73a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756817553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full cont